501136300869573_3988454085229928562_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WHD_H5iB-RgQ7kNvwEw1tUd&_nc_oc=Adnvh8nEFYpCJj3XwjHeaTSFZXqEZnqGc4nw0-LQo_7EfB6wyIHV2T0d7mmVIGmdbHU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvIjXZmfNWjazXR_pSVPnkfKRSntVlRGdc4JEiB62D_hg&oe=69A2F1D5"}, {"file_name": "V8_Engine_03.png", "id": "1078013840882615", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499356638_1078013844215948_4431526408350712785_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cGfNyrJ2DrAQ7kNvwHSNAO8&_nc_oc=AdmnNHYb_0iS8D81ik-y_WzqqhXZWfBSrmO7LteM7_gVOC5YUhdeBT6yJXkzmsgrqJ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuJamS8S-U_d2BoszOXB1rxdhPowATTCy9ZWLGrWR6T0A&oe=69A2E28E"}, {"file_name": "V8_Engine_01.png", "id": "548187144806946", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499324048_548187148140279_302708763491369627_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FrKWqHZd9rkQ7kNvwHr1A7G&_nc_oc=AdkSA8obg2P2jyrHa9J3UspMPJ7BoFhNixWaFPfy3zY5c7Edf9FKxRSGwZoZ0kl7rjI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfttLg-i4c81izV6EDsGTdptfrztKCwMb4jeYmSJqAVZEg&oe=69A2E2F4"}, {"file_name": "V8_Engine_05.png", "id": "1416446512843773", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499324939_1416446516177106_7952489805788314366_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=193bqKSJHYEQ7kNvwFOnCuN&_nc_oc=Adn7I1X6MaW8Tfe-E0M0HOj49lXbkH--0IIH6SmUhjFRdUh9aWdUFYDZaruvIxYqJQM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu8Y_JDMsPZRs5SaW_XhJZ-yAEPk-lZCIUz78yMITRhQw&oe=69A2C73A"}, {"file_name": "V8_Engine_06.png", "id": "1188825093024789", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499333143_1188825096358122_7698089225442683365_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BbISvY2BINYQ7kNvwEWV-BX&_nc_oc=AdkGZ656A8iIcR65VlVAkoSgygJmF4TfuXQCzL2_04Ni5-fy_4uXIFJHJK0bS-Zb13k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvCe-f_juf6H33YNYFvB9_MBsCjyUXdvpVN8UMCoBD8_w&oe=69A2DF51"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "V8 Engine Simulation", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Unlock the mysteries of automotive engineering with our cutting-edge V8 Engine Training Simulator. Immerse yourself in a virtual world where learning meets hands-on experience, allowing enthusiasts, students, and professionals to grasp the intricacies of V8 engine assembly like never before.\n\nPowered by state-of-the-art technology, our simulator utilises a real V8 engine model, providing an authentic and comprehensive learning experience. Whether you're a novice eager to explore the mechanics or a seasoned automotive enthusiast aiming to enhance your knowledge, our simulator caters to all skill levels.\n\nKey Features:\n\n1. Real Engine Integration: Our simulator boasts a genuine V8 engine, enabling users to interact with real components and understand their functions.\n\n2. Interactive Learning Modules: Dive into an array of interactive modules that cover every aspect of V8 engine assembly, from identifying parts to mastering the intricacies of fuel injection systems.\n\n3. Real-Time Feedback: Receive instant feedback on your assembly progress, allowing for continuous improvement and a deeper understanding of the engine's inner workings.\n\n4. Step-by-Step Tutorials: Guided by detailed step-by-step tutorials, users can progress at their own pace, ensuring a thorough grasp of each assembly stage.\n\n\n\n\nUnleash your passion for engines and master the art of V8 assembly like never before!\n", "short_description": "Discover the art of V8 engine assembly with our state-of-the-art Training Simulator! Featuring a real V8 engine, interactive modules, and step-by-step tutorials, our simulator caters to all skill levels. Gain hands-on experience, receive real-time feedback, and master the intricacies of automotive engineering. Elevate your knowledge with our immersive and authentic V8 Engine Training Simulator today! \n"}]}, "d